        <mxCell id="api" value="API HTTP&#10;[Contêiner: Node/NestJS]&#10;&#10;GET/POST /reservations&#10;PUT /reservations/{id}/customer&#10;POST /reservations/{id}/cancellation | withdrawal&#10;Pré-validação (404/422)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1168bd;strokeColor=#0b4884;fontColor=#ffffff;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
